Well, I thought of this while composing that lengthy response, but I did
not want to add it to the end fearing that some of you out there would
not read the entire thing (I know I usually don't :-).

Idea:
	Have every WoP that is created contain only 1 charge, and be
	already recharged!

This limits polypile without taking it away from the player, and still
leaves all of the previous abilities of the wand intact, sans change.

This is very much like the WoW limitation currently in place, and I now
see why the game behaves this way.

I vote for this!

